      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/48/1967_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BlueHairedMeerkat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Related question: Does a removed hero still get a turn (for things like Divine Focus)? I play no, but I'm not really sure…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No. No turn. No Incap ability. They are removed from the game as if they were never there in the first place (except for the [H] number. that does not change)</p>",
