      "raw": "<p>Let&#39;s be truthful, Foote, you just made that up, buddy. ;)&nbsp; Previous rulings have said that if an effect has a stated end time, then the effect will continue until that end time, even if the card is destroyed.&nbsp; So pppery&#39;s supposition is as valid as anything.&nbsp; We don&#39;t really know.</p>",
