      "id": 69055,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-01T21:56:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah your right spiff my bad. It's not immediate. But matchstick is correct that normally, an incapped hero still has a start of turn and end of turn, and galvenize would end then normally.&nbsp;</p><p>But we are talking removed from game here. It's an extremely unique situation and its not unreasonable to expect a unique answer. And if you remove Legacy from the game entirely it is totally within logical reason that any effect he provided would be removed from the game as well.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:47:32.282Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
