      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Yeah your right spiff my bad. It&#39;s not immediate. But matchstick is correct that normally, an incapped hero still has a start of turn and end of turn, and galvenize would end then normally.&nbsp;</p><p>But we are talking removed from game here. It&#39;s an extremely unique situation and its not unreasonable to expect a unique answer. And if you remove Legacy from the game entirely it is totally within logical reason that any effect he provided would be removed from the game as well.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
